      }
    },
    "Use your device unlock to verify your presence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "استخدم قفل جهازك للتحقق من حضورك"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (build %@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الإصدار %1$@ (البنية %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What This App Does Not Do" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ما لا يفعله هذا التطبيق"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you showing up for?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ما الذي تحضر من أجله؟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this app collects" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ما الذي يجمعه هذا التطبيق"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whenever you start, it counts — a short day is still a day shown up for." : {
      "comment" : "Habit reminder body steady.b1 (Android nudge_not_checked_in_body).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "متى بدأت فهو يُحتسب، فاليوم القصير يومٌ حضرتَ فيه أيضًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth showing up for" : {
      "comment" : "Habit reminder title steady.t2 (Android nudge_steady_title_unnamed_2); %1$s is the habit's name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يستحق الحضور"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have a habit with this name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لديك عادة بهذا الاسم بالفعل"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have to take this on trust. Turn on App Privacy Report under Settings, Privacy & Security: it lists every domain each app contacts. This app contacts none." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لست مضطرًا إلى أخذ هذا على الثقة. فعّل «تقرير خصوصية التطبيقات» ضمن الإعدادات، «الخصوصية والأمن»: فهو يعرض كل نطاق يتصل به كل تطبيق. وهذا التطبيق لا يتصل بأي نطاق."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't need a plan for today, just a start." : {
      "comment" : "Habit reminder body not_started.b7 (Android nudge_not_started_body_7).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا تحتاج خطة لليوم، يكفيك أن تبدأ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You know the drill: check in, then begin." : {
      "comment" : "Habit reminder body steady.b6 (Android nudge_steady_body_6).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعرف الطريق: سجّل حضورك ثم ابدأ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You showed up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لقد حضرت"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're here!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أنت هنا!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your camera reports whether a face is in frame. The app reads that and nothing else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُبلغ الكاميرا فقط بوجود وجه في الإطار أو عدمه، ولا يقرأ التطبيق سوى ذلك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your session is still running. It closes on its own at midnight." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جلستك ما زالت جارية، وستُغلق تلقائيًا عند منتصف الليل."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "all time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "كل الأوقات"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "d MMM" : {
      "comment" : "A day on a chart axis: a DateFormatter pattern, not prose (Android date_axis_day_pattern).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "d MMM"
          }
        }
      }
